<th>Title</th>
<td>Internship Program</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th>Image</th>
<td><img class="" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/internship_header.png" alt="Internship Program" width="1775" height="1189" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p style="text-align: left;">An Internship is a quarterly academic program involving an on-the-job placement the student earns via preparation and interviews. A successful Internship is based on professionalism and performance to measurable work site learning objectives directly related to the student's career goals. If a student is interested in exploring careers, an internship can also provide this. Internships are usually non-paid (unless otherwise noted) and offer flexible hours to allow for the student's academic schedule.</p>
<table class="ou-chevron-list"><caption>Chevron List</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Add bulleted list here</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Career Marketability</li>
<li>Resume Development</li>
<li>Explore career options, or transition from one industry to another</li>
<li>Earn <a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/work_experience.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Academic Credit</a></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h5><span style="font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.6;">How to Get Started</span></h5>
<hr />
<h5><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&bull; Complete the&nbsp;<a title="Internship Application" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/pdfs/work_experience/internship_application_2019.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Internship Application</a></span></h5>
<h5><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&bull; Obtain a copy (unofficial) of your transcripts</span></h5>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&bull; Update or create a resume</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&bull; Contact the department to set up an interview time with the program instructor: </span></p>
<p style="padding-left: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Email&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="mailto:workexp@ltcc.edu">workexp@ltcc.edu</a>&nbsp;to get started!</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&bull; Bring your completed application, transcripts, and resume to your interview.</span></p>
